WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.302
-My first guest
is an Oscar-winning actress

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:05.538
who currently stars
in the series "Truth Be Told."

00:00:05.538 --> 00:00:08.674
Season two premieres tomorrow
on Apple TV+.

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:11.911
Please welcome Octavia Spencer!

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.914
Yeah!
That's what I'm talking about!

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:18.550
Ahh! Mwah, mwah, mwah!
Welcome back.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.488
Welcome back to the show, pal.
It's good to see you.

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:24.557
-It's good to see you.

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:26.359
-Last time you were on the show,

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:30.196
you actually were on with
Melissa McCarthy together...

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:31.631
-Yeah.
-...which I appreciated.

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:33.032
-Yeah.

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:35.835
-And it's kind of surprising
to some people to know

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.737
that you guys are
really friends in real life.

00:00:38.737 --> 00:00:42.708
-Yeah, we've been friends
for more than 20 years.

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.677
-Wowzers.
-That's -- Yeah.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:46.813
-Yeah. 20 is a lot.
You actually --

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:48.714
You actually caught the bouquet
at her wedding.

00:00:48.714 --> 00:00:50.149
Is that --

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.818
-Yep, that's me.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:55.588
[ Applause ]

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:59.325
-Was it luck or were you
really going for the bouquet?

00:00:59.325 --> 00:01:01.560
-Oh, honey.
It was roller derby.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:03.863
I was taking everybody out
to get that bouquet.

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.231
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:08.834
-"It was roller derby."
Yeah, exactly.

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:11.236
You're Zooming tonight
from Boston.

00:01:11.236 --> 00:01:12.505
Thank you for doing this.

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:15.808
What are you working on
in Boston?

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:19.979
-I am filming an Apple movie
called "Spirited"

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:23.215
with Will Ferrell
and Ryan Reynolds.

00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:26.152
And it's based on
"A Christmas Carol."

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.486
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.486 --> 00:01:28.988
-Wow.
-Yeah.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:33.326
-I heard about this. Yeah.
That must be fun.

00:01:33.326 --> 00:01:35.828
-It is fun.
I mean, I'm doing stuff

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:39.866
I've never done
in my real life or on film --

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:43.870
you know, ice skating
and singing and dancing.

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:45.705
Whew!

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:49.876
-Yeah, I saw some
ice-skating footage of you,

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:54.747
because you're not
the greatest ice skater.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:55.914
Can we say that?

00:01:55.914 --> 00:01:58.017
-I'm a gold never-ist.

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.653
-Gold never-ist.
Yeah, exactly.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:04.757
But you had to learn
for this film.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.993
And what were the processes?

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.695
Do you remember --
Do you remember learning

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:10.330
with this --

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:12.398
Well, it's like little seal
it looks like?

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:13.799
-I do remember.

00:02:13.799 --> 00:02:17.737
See, the director, you know,
was born in Wisconsin,

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:20.806
and, you know, they just
give birth on the ice.

00:02:20.806 --> 00:02:22.975
Those guys just live
on ice skates.

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:24.644
And I'm from Alabama.

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:26.346
You know, we're born
with footballs.

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:28.914
You know, we don't do that.
-No. Yeah. Exactly.

00:02:28.914 --> 00:02:30.349
-So I had to lace up,

00:02:30.349 --> 00:02:35.455
and I actually thought
I was doing great, you know?

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:37.924
But I wouldn't let go
of the rails.

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:40.325
-Wow.

00:02:40.325 --> 00:02:43.329
-And so they gave me that
little guy to try to help me.

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:46.265
-We have video of how
some of the training went.

00:02:46.265 --> 00:02:48.034
Watch this.

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:51.771
-All right.

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:53.773
-Oh, my God! Don't!

00:02:53.773 --> 00:02:56.609
[ Screaming ]

00:02:56.609 --> 00:02:59.211
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.211 --> 00:03:01.147
Oh!
-You're doing good.

00:03:01.213 --> 00:03:02.649
-Aah!
-You're doing good.

00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.350
-I gotta sit down! I can't!

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.185
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.185 --> 00:03:08.087
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:15.795
-So it's a fast-paced
action movie, right?

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:18.364
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:20.366
-Hey.
I was glad to cross that ice.

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:25.204
That was like
"Chariots of Fire."

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:29.342
-You've been working
for a long time in Hollywood.

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:32.712
And, starting out,
what's your advice for people

00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:35.381
that are just starting out and
want to break into the business?

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:39.052
-Oh, my God.
I worked behind the scenes.

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:42.521
In my very first job,
I literally --

00:03:42.521 --> 00:03:44.957
I had to be creative,

00:03:44.957 --> 00:03:48.227
and I kept calling
this one place every day.

00:03:48.227 --> 00:03:51.363
[Laughing]
And I would disguise my voice.

00:03:51.363 --> 00:03:53.566
Because the same guy
answered the phone.

00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:56.536
And I would just go, "Ah, yes,
are you taking résumés?"

00:03:56.536 --> 00:03:59.839
And -- [Deep voice] "Yes, I'd
like to send in my résumé."

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:03.075
[Normal voice] So, after
about seven days of that,

00:04:03.075 --> 00:04:05.111
I mean, you know
he was just so exasperated,

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:06.979
so I started showing up
when I found out

00:04:06.979 --> 00:04:08.781
where their office was.

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:11.584
-Wow. You were persistent.

00:04:11.584 --> 00:04:13.585
Persistence.
-Very persistent.

00:04:13.585 --> 00:04:15.254
-Yeah.
-Thank you!

00:04:15.254 --> 00:04:18.057
-Yes. Exactly.
Not stalker. Persistent. Yeah.

00:04:18.057 --> 00:04:19.692
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:22.428
So you start there,
and you're not even --

00:04:22.428 --> 00:04:23.729
you're not even acting.

00:04:23.729 --> 00:04:25.931
You just want to be
around the business.

00:04:25.931 --> 00:04:29.635
-Yes. I did. I --
You know what?

00:04:29.635 --> 00:04:31.204
That's a wonderful way
to put it. And I --

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:35.641
The directors, you know --
I actually broke through,

00:04:35.641 --> 00:04:38.110
and they gave me a job
and paid me $100 a week

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:40.379
in casting as an intern.

00:04:40.379 --> 00:04:41.914
And then I thought I was rich

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:44.216
when they started
paying me $500 a week.

00:04:44.216 --> 00:04:46.986
-Yeah.
-And then the directors

00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:49.955
actually started asking me
to read for stuff.

00:04:49.955 --> 00:04:52.791
-And now here you are,
yeah, winning an Oscar.

00:04:52.791 --> 00:04:54.961
And, yeah,
congrats on everything.

00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:57.063
What a great career.
-Thank you, thank you.

00:04:57.063 --> 00:04:58.631
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:58.631 --> 00:05:01.667
-"Truth Be Told."
Let's talk about this.

00:05:01.667 --> 00:05:03.869
"Truth Be Told" season two
is out tomorrow.

00:05:03.869 --> 00:05:05.738
Apple TV+.

00:05:05.738 --> 00:05:08.141
Kate Hudson joins the cast.
Come on.

00:05:08.141 --> 00:05:09.808
-Yes.
-I love Kate Hudson.

00:05:09.808 --> 00:05:11.544
-I play a podcaster,

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:15.281
and Kate is this

00:05:15.281 --> 00:05:19.251
world-renowned guru,

00:05:19.251 --> 00:05:24.323
you know, teaching people
how to deal with grief

00:05:24.323 --> 00:05:28.528
and so many other things
to enhance their lives.

00:05:28.528 --> 00:05:32.230
And her -- She and I
are childhood friends.

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:33.999
And her husband dies,

00:05:33.999 --> 00:05:37.603
and she asks me
to look into the case.

00:05:37.603 --> 00:05:40.973
-Yeah, if you love true crime
and you like podcasts

00:05:40.973 --> 00:05:43.942
and you love good acting,
great acting,

00:05:43.942 --> 00:05:45.978
you've got to watch this.

00:05:45.978 --> 00:05:47.313
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:05:47.313 --> 00:05:49.982
Here's Octavia Spencer
and Kate Hudson

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:52.351
in "Truth Be Told."
Take a look at this.

00:05:52.351 --> 00:05:55.588
-I put myself in a lot
of danger last year.

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:57.156
♪♪

00:05:57.156 --> 00:05:58.957
Ingram. My father, too.

00:05:58.957 --> 00:06:02.795
And you know
what happened with...

00:06:02.795 --> 00:06:04.496
-Joshua would do it
if it were you.

00:06:04.496 --> 00:06:06.766
-It's not that simple.

00:06:06.766 --> 00:06:10.469
-Poppy, please. Please.

00:06:10.469 --> 00:06:12.604
-Seeking answers

00:06:12.604 --> 00:06:17.209
is never a straight line.

00:06:17.209 --> 00:06:20.613
I won't only find out
what you want me to know.

00:06:20.613 --> 00:06:22.882
-I don't care about that.
-But I do.

00:06:22.882 --> 00:06:26.252
-Yeah! Octavia Spencer.

00:06:26.252 --> 00:06:28.888
Season two of "Truth Be Told"

00:06:28.888 --> 00:06:31.323
premieres tomorrow on Apple TV+.

00:06:31.323 --> 00:06:33.759
Thank you so much for coming
on the show. We love you.

00:06:33.759 --> 00:06:35.728
-Thank you.
-We'll be right back.

